    <node id="Managers">
      <data key="d0">Managers</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Managers are individuals in management positions within a company, responsible for overseeing and directing activities within an organization. They play an important role in dealing with complexity, organizing work, and managing employees and work processes. These individuals are responsible for managing and making decisions, utilizing organizational technology, and investing resources. Their numbers are growing in various sectors, including healthcare, which potentially indicates inefficiencies. Some traditional managers and consultants believe they are doing things correctly. The increasing number of managers is highlighted as a potential problem.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1f2d6d5047300f276afc27cb0492fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8944df9960d4627149b020e777cd05a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02d52f39ba6d443c4c785ca07baab507&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b6fb6f36600ddc06182a744a53d94c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47363a685d597def513028d54de566e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4939f4e8ac2c42709b9b12969f13fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4abcf863944b9861fe59af11c939f629&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87061ff3ee8f59f38b049fb3900799a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4198bb76b5c7a4e6c4e4bf6a530fdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9307eb9588b1ba095c834baa14602b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf7f03bab56e9193f4290651ca3c42c</data>
