    <node id="Weconomics">
      <data key="d0">Weconomics</data>
      <data key="d1">Organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Weconomics is a multifaceted concept and organization, deeply intertwined with blockchain technology and new organizational models. It represents a form of New Organizing, specifically related to Blockchain Organizing, and is characterized as a fundamentally new organizational model, infrastructure, and validated transition program. Weconomics is a key concept in Blockchain Organizing, and it is also a new model for organizing supply and demand.

The organization is associated with an analysis book, specifically "Patterns that predict the future," and a practice book. It is mentioned in the context of historical perspectives of the Internet and is likely related to the communication of Weconomics. Weconomics analyzes economic aspects, particularly within the context of blockchain organizations, and provides background information and resources related to blockchain technology. The organization is also mentioned in relation to the ARPA project. Weconomics can be understood as a way of thinking and organizing projects, built upon three pillars: organizational model, infrastructure, and transition program.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77b4bcb1ad6558b972215f2dcea8a2ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6356289eb89ea3c9fb9f8aeb2f5cfa59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35554d8f41f52c69d22444b00c08876e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4198bb76b5c7a4e6c4e4bf6a530fdec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02d52f39ba6d443c4c785ca07baab507&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19098cf3a0c49ab4c21a0a5dd8820f48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46057989310d5a9fbbe08e681d5994eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a077a85d3f0dd5b451d9b582ad0180e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b08a16c5fa8b5090e0317a4cf1d8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04489f0f6d4481123c396d65b8ce3d29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d8c581b75ce0f3a97084b5afbc810e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ecc14a7cf5d97ad967ad26d91665e02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11304546e84047544f7ab77d780c1f76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9307eb9588b1ba095c834baa14602b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7790e270abe48659de241763cc295ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66c04437d924c888b68f0a652726f850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389d7c5f1d20f1422327d2a14583ff07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18658aae4eca132d93e07ad23124b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f0573de7c7cbde2e2975eead953b1b1</data>
