    <node id="Organizational Model">
      <data key="d0">Organizational Model</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A framework or structure for organizing and managing an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework that describes how an organization is structured and operates.&lt;SEP&gt;A new design or model for the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the three pillars of Weconomics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5438dd33a2364da1b72551b2df52f1d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9307eb9588b1ba095c834baa14602b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158f8bc907835844a3f304c334f72115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c47a02b57022bf2a5d925c348057a2</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Infrastructure">
      <data key="d0">Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d1">Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d2">Infrastructure is one of the three pillars of Weconomics. It encompasses the basic physical and organizational structures and facilities essential for the operation of a society or enterprise. This includes buildings, roads, power supplies, and the underlying framework for a system or network. Infrastructure also refers to the agreements that facilitate increased cooperation and the underlying systems and structures that support a community, enabling the connection of people and resources. In the context of Weconomics, Blockchain Organizing, and social media platforms, infrastructure represents the framework that supports their operation and the construction and maintenance of their respective networks.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-23ed9dc93c794a4140007b73566dbfb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01616b5179550e4bd0aa2f4aec943768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8de7684eaa9214e3bd145ee0ad6dd5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7a4f0543c997bbae168f719fdd65986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4e508645dafe5462c20f99b327c186&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcb530cf287b37d28b085c805c61d13c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f3d062a707dfb7235caa4e344995d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b863d6e3078036af759c206058182dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9307eb9588b1ba095c834baa14602b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158f8bc907835844a3f304c334f72115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f0573de7c7cbde2e2975eead953b1b1</data>
