    <node id="Digitalization">
      <data key="d0">Digitalization</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A process that reduces transaction costs.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of converting analog information into a digital format, often involving a new organizational model.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of converting information into a digital format.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of processing transactions between the smallest organization units in an autonomous and decentralized way.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of transforming information into a digital format.</data>
