    <node id="Trust">
      <data key="d0">Trust</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Trust is a broad and complex concept, fundamental to various aspects of life, including communication, trade, economy, and society. It is often described as the "glue of life" and a key element in addressing unrest and insecurity. Trust involves confidence in the integrity, reliability, or fairness of someone or something, and is the belief that others will act in a certain way. It is also defined as firm reliance on the integrity, ability, or character of a person or thing, or the reliance on the integrity, strength, ability, or surety of a person or thing.

Trust is essential for the value of a medium of exchange and is something that companies are organizing. It is related to Blockchain Organizing and can be gained without additional intermediaries. The state of being reliable, safe, or strong is also a component of trust, and it can be organized without increasing bureaucracy or complexity, giving more freedom, which can be supplemented by control mechanisms.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7790e270abe48659de241763cc295ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a9c26deb5facb68529f8f7701c4bd55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f2d6d5047300f276afc27cb0492fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb1e3dfd567d51e6d05f0dc833e60f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c7ba153eb5a0d7f103744153505eb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e1aaefe2d119ce580dcd7142980a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0158f505b78daad05d6ccc48a0249c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-544c2611bcdf82d1952de94fef47569e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0dd82da1fab20609f22f1ba5505c2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f03d2d17c7bf1cc4e87ff716b4c883a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691633ed3dd644b2a539f78fc15edeca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79c54d1dcf033e326cc5bd8015d79f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c15060b3efddd80e4c7258443033b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1dbef1dcc5103193b5bebcfc5f3f62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce508aba4aa5d17fb6f6c48acdcd7ca8</data>
