    <node id="Digital Transformation">
      <data key="d0">Digital Transformation</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The global shift where digital and physical realities merge.&lt;SEP&gt;The ongoing shift where the physical and digital worlds merge, impacting how people live and work.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of changing the way an organization operates using digital technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of integrating digital technology into all areas of a business, fundamentally changing how you operate and deliver value to customers.&lt;SEP&gt;The rapid pace of digital transformation.</data>
