    <node id="Technology">
      <data key="d0">Technology</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Technology is a broad term encompassing the application of scientific knowledge for practical purposes. It refers to the technical means people use to improve their surroundings, including advancements in various fields. In the context of the provided descriptions, technology specifically refers to blockchain technology, a distributed, immutable ledger used to record transactions and data in a secure and transparent manner. The application of technology, especially in industry, is discussed, including the adoption of new technologies like blockchain and the impact of using various tools. The text also mentions the use of technology, including ICT, cloud computing, and the internet, and its role in driving or leading an organization.
</data>
