    <node id="Innovation">
      <data key="d0">Innovation</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Innovation is a concept associated with solving practical problems. It is a recommended process involving the introduction of new ideas, methods, or devices. This includes innovating new products, services, and processes. It can also be described as the introduction of something new, often associated with matter.
</data>
