      <data key="d0">Hierarchies</data>
      <data key="d1">Organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A system of organization in which people or groups are ranked one above the other according to status or authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Structures where organization costs are incurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Systems of organization where people or groups are ranked one above the other according to status or authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Systems of ranking and authority within an organization.</data>
