    <node id="Supply">
      <data key="d0">Supply</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Supply refers to the products or services available in the market. It encompasses the amount of a good or service accessible to consumers, businesses, and governments. This includes the total amount of goods and services available, and the process of providing these goods or services. Supply involves the provision of goods or services, a process that can be enhanced using blockchain technology. Furthermore, supply also includes the specialists and resources available to meet the demand within a specific context, such as Blockchain Organizing.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-daf93ecb6c683f40f1d34d737bcdd9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1900d9fbbbeb4ce6f5731ed0181e0729&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1038536712133e45dde6e4266ae93a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92a25fd0e21cd743e62c34c35ca67a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc20e87e2ee483ddd4598fa7842b42be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601da3b0bece1d5e1adfbd71567fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab58813161f8d97d9bd6f12223a7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b8cc34d6b3608e77a895b028c9a6d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c3c3f074053a1775cb07219c0c1260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce508aba4aa5d17fb6f6c48acdcd7ca8</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Demand">
      <data key="d0">Demand</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Demand refers to the needs and desires of the market, specifically the desire of consumers, businesses, and governments for goods or services. It represents the desire to purchase a particular commodity, service, or other item. Demand is the need or problem that Blockchain Organizing aims to solve, and can be formulated better using blockchain technology.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-daf93ecb6c683f40f1d34d737bcdd9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1900d9fbbbeb4ce6f5731ed0181e0729&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1038536712133e45dde6e4266ae93a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92a25fd0e21cd743e62c34c35ca67a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc20e87e2ee483ddd4598fa7842b42be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601da3b0bece1d5e1adfbd71567fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab58813161f8d97d9bd6f12223a7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11b8cc34d6b3608e77a895b028c9a6d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c3c3f074053a1775cb07219c0c1260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce508aba4aa5d17fb6f6c48acdcd7ca8</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Work">
      <data key="d0">Work</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Work encompasses a wide range of activities centered around the production of goods and services. It involves both mental and physical effort directed towards achieving a specific purpose or result. This effort is expended to produce or accomplish something, and it includes providing added value from supply to demand. Work is a fundamental activity that is organized and managed, and the organization of work and its impact on complexity are key considerations.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ebde21af6f93489c1d70ecb9ced229b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af499d61f5968bcd65d0631a51264c34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc20e87e2ee483ddd4598fa7842b42be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e85864faafbd1d1ed88636d104909c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e4f60dfd1366a24d0989693fd1426e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e57e76e58e2792cffba385c065f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce508aba4aa5d17fb6f6c48acdcd7ca8</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
