    <node id="Authors">
      <data key="d0">Authors</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Individuals who wrote the book.&lt;SEP&gt;The authors of the book.&lt;SEP&gt;The individuals who wrote the book.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66fa1dabac7d48ccdc8364b9cd90ca8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3279f311b201e497520d3f11f157f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bdc886b23f3ebaa015732c5dc3db208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc20e87e2ee483ddd4598fa7842b42be</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Blockchain Technology">
      <data key="d0">Blockchain Technology</data>
      <data key="d1">Technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Blockchain technology is a distributed ledger technology (DLT) that records transactions across multiple computers in a secure and transparent manner. It is an immutable ledger, meaning that once a transaction is recorded, it cannot be altered. This technology is used for secure and transparent data management and sharing, particularly in supply chain management. Blockchain technology can be programmed and used to formulate demand, profile supply, and coordinate demand and supply, creating a system that can make better and more efficient choices, reducing friction. It facilitates reputation management and can be used for countering fake news or fake work.

Blockchain technology can be added to existing peer-to-peer platforms or online communities for secure and faultless processes, especially in payment systems. It can also be used for offering, searching, booking, and paying for management services, reducing the need for human involvement. This technology provides the functionality for digital society and enables secure and transparent transactions through a distributed ledger. It is the underlying technology upon which Bitcoin is built and is being evaluated for its potential applications in various organizations. It is a technology that is the focus of organizational embedding, described in the text as a potential large-scale intervention. It is compared to the development of the assembly line and the internet. It is used to make the company stronger than the competition. It is used to create a shared reality about possessing value or not, or about including a transaction in a block or not. It serves as a basis for trust and subsequent transactions.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4a01d2b4552736dc870cfe78ddc18388&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be89e365c019f2fcc2432c91f0e473b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15a70031415a373cab08355dc72cc16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1038536712133e45dde6e4266ae93a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f4323a294fdbd03686f0af42313fca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc20e87e2ee483ddd4598fa7842b42be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1159f0e0de86630155e1bc94285ff20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c3c3f074053a1775cb07219c0c1260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a15e0f6d912773be3b201f8652ca407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e4d7c93b13ce48f7dc9be0964a62044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c7ba153eb5a0d7f103744153505eb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92a25fd0e21cd743e62c34c35ca67a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14006971adc9b69dc7d7fac47447cd49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba7d2662c30d83dd2e16a7c0cb197ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51acb320616574b3b600a83911d634cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522eff26325273b3d80fc7113230a497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5764b11860bd97da66e34d549f66280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c97cbc55e4d5c208212c7c5fab62f82e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd10a20a830bf4ba4fd072ae7212cb97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf7f03bab56e9193f4290651ca3c42c</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
