    <node id="GDPR">
      <data key="d0">GDPR</data>
      <data key="d1">Policy</data>
      <data key="d2">The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is a European legislation and privacy law focused on data protection. It is a set of regulations that organizations must adhere to, specifically within the European Union and the European Economic Area. The GDPR is described as potentially requiring a shift in mindset and IT architecture.
</data>
