      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Personal Data Service is a comprehensive system designed for managing and providing access to personal data. This service encompasses various aspects of personal data, including financial information, and is particularly relevant to employees. It functions as a system for storing employee data and managing an individual's personal data. The service is also mentioned in relation to Data as a Service (DAAS) and is focused on personal data management.
</data>
