      <data key="d1">Organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Facebook is a social media and social networking platform designed to maximize user engagement and advertising revenue. It utilizes user data for advertising and dataset creation. The platform also functions as a way to log into other websites and can be used to log on to a cloud service. It is also a peer-to-peer business platform. Facebook has been the subject of discussion, including the book "How to Fix Facebook - Before It Fixes Us."
</data>
