      <data key="d1">Technology</data>
      <data key="d2">A combination of private and public blockchain characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of blockchain setup. It is mentioned as a way to organize trust without increasing bureaucracy.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of blockchain that combines features of both public and permissioned blockchains.&lt;SEP&gt;Blockchains similar to login websites.</data>
