      <data key="d0">Blockchain Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d1">Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d2">Infrastructure related to blockchain.&lt;SEP&gt;The underlying framework for blockchain technology, considered crucial for long-term social breakthroughs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0197eeb8e7c7c337867cce9066008c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a01d2b4552736dc870cfe78ddc18388</data>
