    <node id="Bureaucracy">
      <data key="d0">Bureaucracy</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A factor that increases organization costs.&lt;SEP&gt;A system of government in which most of the important decisions are taken by state officials rather than by elected representatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Excessive administration. The text discusses how to organize trust without increasing bureaucracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Excessive bureaucracy, discussed in the context of its costs and impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Not increased by Blockchain Organizing</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5c7ba153eb5a0d7f103744153505eb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e1aaefe2d119ce580dcd7142980a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4584c12e3206f6c6114919230c973aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e159991e1f1aeb8a0169a48ad5b8333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf7f03bab56e9193f4290651ca3c42c</data>
