    <node id="Consultants">
      <data key="d0">Consultants</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Consultants are external advisors, individuals, or organizations that provide expert advice and services. They support managers in navigating complexity and organizing work, often utilizing organizational technology. Some consultants specialize in providing advice on technologies. However, the term also encompasses traditional managers and consultants who may believe their methods are correct.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-176dd1da8e079fd40e57f6f813858c25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b6fb6f36600ddc06182a744a53d94c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15a70031415a373cab08355dc72cc16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfbd7696004d27418aab66bbd972213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4939f4e8ac2c42709b9b12969f13fb6</data>
