    </node>
    <node id="Professionals">
      <data key="d0">Professionals</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Individuals who aim to contribute to providing more welfare for more people and are not focused on earning money through complexity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Growth DNA">
      <data key="d0">Growth DNA</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The tendency of entrepreneurs to pursue growth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="System">
      <data key="d0">System</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The **System** is a multifaceted entity, encompassing both technological and economic aspects. It is being developed collaboratively by Walmart, IBM, and Tsinghua University to verify identities and facilitate connections, with transactions logged within the system. This system is designed to optimize decision-making, thereby reducing friction and enhancing efficiency. It is also an abstract entity that requires trust to function effectively. Furthermore, the **System** is described as a mechanical system that learns through feedback loops, and the current economic system that promotes growth. The existing **System** is undergoing adjustments to best adapt to changing circumstances, aiming to minimize friction costs.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2a295291e4a9f16baa0f819554e218f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb686b1805befa2a119993ae3948d96b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20263a74555022bcb03d540326fa1129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b6fb6f36600ddc06182a744a53d94c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-497448aabe99719662885659f3d468d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c0ccfa5fc8eaee15a7d1f79a23dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c3c3f074053a1775cb07219c0c1260d</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
