      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">A person for whom organizing trust is a core activity.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who wonders if they can trust their employees.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals who manage a limited number of people within an organization. They are involved in the structure and hierarchy of the company.</data>
