    <node id="Organizational Technology">
      <data key="d0">Organizational Technology</data>
      <data key="d1">Technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Organizational Technology encompasses new technologies and organizational forms that organizations utilize. This technology is employed to expedite work processes, organize capacity effectively, and reduce the number of intermediaries involved. Furthermore, Organizational Technology aims to lower transaction costs within the organization.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1f2d6d5047300f276afc27cb0492fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c7ba153eb5a0d7f103744153505eb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb325ff3876e609f14b5256360d8deec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33012de7a0074f352d461a49b8eb5bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2982d87bc41ece8bbd334a6d0e1eaf70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1dbef1dcc5103193b5bebcfc5f3f62</data>
