      <data key="d1">Technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Information Technology department within an organization.")&lt;SEP&gt;Information Technology, used as a resource by organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Information Technology, used to solve the privacy problem.&lt;SEP&gt;Technology mentioned in the context of productivity.</data>
