    <node id="Network">
      <data key="d0">Network</data>
      <data key="d1">System</data>
      <data key="d2">A **Network** is a multifaceted system encompassing interconnected computers, devices, people, or things. It can be described as a collection of entities, potentially including organizations and individuals, that collaborate to achieve a common goal. Networks utilize communication technologies, such as the internet, to connect these entities. This interconnected system can be neutral and distributed, employing peer-to-peer connections. A network facilitates transactions, which distribute themselves across all nodes. The **Bitcoin network** is a specific example, requiring maintenance, and it, along with the entire blockchain network, validates transactions, establishing trust within the system.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8916767299a57ae0cfc7243089fb2212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebde21af6f93489c1d70ecb9ced229b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54ae90ff07e4d84d7a1591868bfd384c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3616e23745945cf7521047d73b382ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e7516ac1d2c2eabb8e7a0eb0c8233aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19098cf3a0c49ab4c21a0a5dd8820f48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9fc0782a2ca0ad992c87fd04cc684c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ab58813161f8d97d9bd6f12223a7b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1dbef1dcc5103193b5bebcfc5f3f62</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Customers">
      <data key="d0">Customers</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">Customers are individuals or entities that purchase goods or services. They are participants in a network community and stakeholders who cooperate within the Blockchain Organizing framework. Customers purchase goods or services from organizations and businesses.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d4a60c136a5d1432d80e9a3cf2dce937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d935bc8938352c154222fd6602c580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1dbef1dcc5103193b5bebcfc5f3f62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bc3db8823c5e5cacf0a55cc60c785f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ddf3937d82ce7155cb82041f93c070&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc</data>
