      <data key="d1">Algorithm</data>
      <data key="d2">A process or set of rules to be followed in calculations or other problem-solving operations, especially by a computer.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-transparent algorithms used by American tech companies.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific algorithms used to make connections meaningful, secure, and reliable."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1fcc88ddd3e1416c5f15ff137621b16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01616b5179550e4bd0aa2f4aec943768</data>
