    <node id="Community">
      <data key="d0">Community</data>
      <data key="d1">Organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The **Community** is a multifaceted concept, often defined as a group of people connected by shared values, goals, or interests. This can manifest in various ways, including a group of hirers and portfolio workers cooperating, individuals living in the same place or sharing a common characteristic, or people interacting online. The term is frequently used within the context of Blockchain organizing, where it represents a group of people working together, sharing information and transaction networks, and supporting common goals. This can include shared service centers and those who believe in the value of Bitcoin and support its use. The **Community** is central to the organizational framework discussed, emphasizing shared purpose and values.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fd5472ddb6ce206d59469e54f3662336&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69efea1dbe09587f8af78dcc05834412&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e7516ac1d2c2eabb8e7a0eb0c8233aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0dd82da1fab20609f22f1ba5505c2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcb530cf287b37d28b085c805c61d13c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fbe78c31b971b562ee63011e226a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158f8bc907835844a3f304c334f72115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0697bcc736e38c4eecf7ba0b89208980</data>
