    <node id="Policy">
      <data key="d0">Policy</data>
      <data key="d1">Policy</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of rules and guidelines designed to prevent concentration of power and promote transparency within an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of rules or guidelines that govern behavior or actions.&lt;SEP&gt;An effective policy regarding the organization of fixed, flex, and hybrid positions or projects within Blockchain Organizing."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The government ratifies a new privacy law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1ef570382baecc1b0372c031d77bc626&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaf875f9fbc369b9ab166da3e3a5506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e159991e1f1aeb8a0169a48ad5b8333&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc</data>
