    <node id="Smart Contracts">
      <data key="d0">Smart Contracts</data>
      <data key="d1">Technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Smart Contracts are self-executing contracts stored on a blockchain. They are written with the terms of the agreement directly in code and execute transactions based on a technical script. This technology is useful in multi-party situations, non-transparent markets, high transaction costs, and areas with few regulations. Smart contracts automate processes, reduce the need for intermediaries, and enable automated agreements and transactions within Blockchain Organizing.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01616b5179550e4bd0aa2f4aec943768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d9c783fe7141c81f49edd0fdc5f7e7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1159f0e0de86630155e1bc94285ff20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691633ed3dd644b2a539f78fc15edeca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760373765c10662d9065ee92ab95d40e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248aad6ba79eb8e5e5f575bda42587cc</data>
