    </node>
    <node id="Majority">
      <data key="d0">Majority</data>
      <data key="d1">Process</data>
      <data key="d2">A decision-making process where the majority of parties agree.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-439e69ca41d62eb2197ac8d9898d5561</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Productivity">
      <data key="d0">Productivity</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Productivity refers to the general subject of efficiency and output within a system, particularly in industry and offices. It encompasses the effectiveness of productive effort and the efficiency of production, which can be measured by output per unit of input. Productivity is crucial for creating time and attention, and it can be improved through various means, including the use of Blockchain Organizing and ICT. The state or quality of producing something, such as crops, goods, or other benefits, is also a key aspect of productivity. The internet, for example, has the promise to increase productivity.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-439e69ca41d62eb2197ac8d9898d5561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ff2bae129946f137ba1974c04412962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20dfcb1ed444583cbd70a2d248cf5c41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bb7630f85643e1cb2d411ec7e989e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c15060b3efddd80e4c7258443033b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9bb1f5dfc6645013b98c9aa9eb80594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f6ed8dcd79c56128d3004672a382fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f3afddce8bc964731907b7d70c528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfbd7696004d27418aab66bbd972213</data>
