    </node>
    <node id="Buyer">
      <data key="d0">Buyer</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">The **Buyer** is a party involved in a transaction, specifically the one purchasing goods or services. This can be an individual or another entity. The buyer is the entity that desires value and receives it, and is also the party receiving goods or services. In the context of the VRM model, the buyer is the entity in control.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ebde21af6f93489c1d70ecb9ced229b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c88e24a0ff0bacee61712e00986bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8944df9960d4627149b020e777cd05a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18dd982db79e8473ac2f97c0dc81f06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b21a1bc67d35ccf8eb386ac622f736d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66c04437d924c888b68f0a652726f850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fcc88ddd3e1416c5f15ff137621b16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f03d2d17c7bf1cc4e87ff716b4c883a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9fb12d3474b8c2ae92a04bb0e1f9c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee92635ddcf90a64b087c72dedf9473d</data>
