      <data key="d0">Hierarchy</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A structured system used by companies to manage employees and control the span of management. It involves teams and departmental staff.&lt;SEP&gt;A system of organization where individuals or groups are ranked one above the other according to authority or status.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or organization in which people or groups are ranked one above the other according to status or authority.&lt;SEP&gt;An organizing form, often used in companies.</data>
