    <node id="Organizational Science">
      <data key="d0">Organizational Science</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A field of expertise focused on organizational structures and processes, particularly relevant in dynamic times with social challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;A field of study. It is mentioned in the context of organizational technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The study of how organizations function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e554ae841a9d31896009d6df8e3254e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4939f4e8ac2c42709b9b12969f13fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9fb12d3474b8c2ae92a04bb0e1f9c32</data>
