    </node>
    <node id="Data">
      <data key="d0">Data</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Data refers to facts and statistics collected for reference or analysis. It encompasses information that can be stored, processed, and used in transactions and other processes. This information, including facts and numbers, is collected to be examined and used for decision-making. Data is considered one of the most important production factors currently. It serves as the raw material for various applications, including the production of adverts and datasets, and is processed by computers to be converted into useful information. In the context of DAOs, data is also a crucial element.
</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e554ae841a9d31896009d6df8e3254e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7053ac151da1f263aafad6644af216a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-850baea3e17909d3830c9a33048570bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b863d6e3078036af759c206058182dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f9fe9648a4981d3053e59b4400ece92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf1a7aaec267ee2b366c8c22e09aabb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ecc14a7cf5d97ad967ad26d91665e02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa9a12c73aebf9f439468bb7d05f82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fcc88ddd3e1416c5f15ff137621b16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88c1ad4f342b0d4793feb21264904c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1038536712133e45dde6e4266ae93a7a</data>
