      <data key="d0">Hybrid Organizational Forms</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Organizational structures that combine elements of different organizational models, aiming for scalability, flexibility, and transparency.")</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0f8fadc0931656aec9e585dab69a412e</data>
