    </node>
    <node id="Competition">
      <data key="d0">Competition</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A concept discussed in the text, contrasted with cooperation, and its relevance is questioned.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of striving against others for dominance or resources, a counterpart to cooperation.&lt;SEP&gt;The activity or condition of striving to gain or win something by defeating or establishing superiority over others.")</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b33ea2da57d21a7eb6228fb95e11f197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f8fadc0931656aec9e585dab69a412e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23db6b509ce85251954b0c6eceb7e526</data>
