    <node id="Payment">
      <data key="d0">Payment</data>
      <data key="d1">Process</data>
      <data key="d2">A **Payment** is the act of transferring money or value, typically in exchange for goods or services. It encompasses the process of executing a transaction and can be facilitated by various methods, including blockchain technology. Payments involve the transfer of funds or value, which is often recorded, such as in the case of blockchain, where the transfer of value is recorded.
</data>
