      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A problem in which armies must trust each other before attacking a fortified city. It involves coordination, consensus, and the potential for betrayal. The core issue is how to ensure reliable communication and decision-making in the face of untrustworthy elements.</data>
