      <data key="d2">The individual or entity that mined the first bitcoin, potentially becoming wealthy.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual who released the first Bitcoin and invited others to participate in the network. He also wrote about the core design of Bitcoin.&lt;SEP&gt;The originator of the original idea of decentralization.&lt;SEP&gt;The pseudonymous person or group who created Bitcoin.</data>
