    <node id="HRM">
      <data key="d0">HRM</data>
      <data key="d1">System</data>
      <data key="d2">A system used to record personal data.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Resource Management, a system that focuses on the perspective of organizations, such as companies, banks, or government authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Resource Management, the management of people within an organization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1d935bc8938352c154222fd6602c580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15a70031415a373cab08355dc72cc16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c514e71a44aea9915f71ae5b109dc21</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CRM">
      <data key="d0">CRM</data>
      <data key="d1">System</data>
      <data key="d2">A system used to record personal data.&lt;SEP&gt;CRM (Customer Relationship Management) is a business model that involves high transaction costs such as branding, marketing, targeting, capturing, acquiring, lock-in and managing.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer Relationship Management, a system that focuses on the perspective of organizations, such as companies, banks, or government authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer Relationship Management, a system used by organizations to manage interactions with customers, often supported by an IT system.</data>
