      <data key="d0">Doc Searls</data>
      <data key="d1">Stakeholder</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual who started a project at the Berkman Centre for Internet &amp; Society at Harvard University, and also did a podcast with Mike Vizard.&lt;SEP&gt;Doc Searls is a person who had a conversation with Mike Vizard about VRM and started the ProjectVRM.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a18dd982db79e8473ac2f97c0dc81f06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c514e71a44aea9915f71ae5b109dc21</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
