      <data key="d1">Policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Existing legislation that new initiatives like Uber and Airbnb are faced by.&lt;SEP&gt;The body of laws and regulations governing a particular area or activity. In this context, it refers to government rules and regulations that may impact DAOs."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-88c1ad4f342b0d4793feb21264904c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9bd6f99a4d3a44dfd7145bcf2becde</data>
      <data key="d4">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </node>
