      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Groups of individuals or entities, such as companies and their customers, or councils and their citizens, that interact and share common interests.&lt;SEP&gt;Groups of people with shared interests or goals.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the stakeholders involved in the project, potentially representing groups of people with shared interests or goals.</data>
