    <node id="Pioneer">
      <data key="d0">Pioneer</data>
      <data key="d1">Concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An entrepreneur who is one of the first to enter a certain domain, and has to find his way in there. They cannot use the experience of another person who has ever been there.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual or entity that is the first to develop or use a new method, technology, or idea. They are characterized by their ability to see solutions, embrace change, and create value."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-423ffa543c10f11e4b79c88ae6b7ff53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b797e6787eb97f68aec8cea878f144b9</data>
