    <edge source="Blockchain" target="Blockchain Organizing">
      <data key="d5">31.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain Organizing is a concept that leverages Blockchain technology for organizational purposes. It is a new management concept that combines blockchain technology with organizational models. Blockchain is a core technology and key component of Blockchain Organizing, which utilizes blockchain technology as a core component. Blockchain Organizing is the application of blockchain technology to organizational structures and processes, facilitating cooperation, competition, and secure, transparent transactions. It is a context for innovation, and the process involves setting up and managing blockchain, requiring specific expertise. Blockchain Organizing uses blockchain technology for recording transactions and is related to the functionality of blockchain.
</data>
      <data key="d7">Application&lt;SEP&gt;Blockchain, Management, Organization&lt;SEP&gt;Component, Integration&lt;SEP&gt;Function, Concept&lt;SEP&gt;Implementation, Management&lt;SEP&gt;Security, Transparency&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Adoption&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Adoption, Management&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Application&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Integration&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Use&lt;SEP&gt;Technology, Application&lt;SEP&gt;Technology, Implementation</data>
