    <edge source="Blockchain" target="Transaction">
      <data key="d5">12.0</data>
      <data key="d6">The **Blockchain** is a technology used extensively in the management, processing, recording, and execution of **transactions**. It serves to initiate, check, and register these transactions. **Transactions** are added, included, and recorded as blocks on the **Blockchain**.
</data>
