    <edge source="Blockchain" target="Bitcoin">
      <data key="d5">9.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Bitcoin is an application of blockchain technology, built upon it as its underlying infrastructure. Bitcoin operates on a blockchain, utilizing it to record transactions. Blockchain technology serves as the foundation for Bitcoin, and is used for Bitcoin transactions. However, the relationship between Bitcoin and blockchain can be seen as one of contrast, with Bitcoin potentially posing a threat while blockchain is being applied in other contexts.
</data>
