    <edge source="Blockchain" target="Internet">
      <data key="d5">8.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain technology is often compared to the development of the Internet. It is described as an additional layer built on top of the Internet, utilizing the packet switching principle, which is also the basis for the Internet. The current state of blockchain is likened to the early days of the Internet, suggesting significant potential for future development. However, the text also warns against repeating the mistakes of the Internet with Blockchain, emphasizing the need to learn from the past to avoid similar shortcomings in productivity and democratic progress.
</data>
