    <edge source="Management" target="Blockchain Organizing">
      <data key="d5">8.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain Organizing is a novel concept focused on fundamentally innovating and reinventing management. It aims to change the way management is approached, shifting the perspective from improving traditional methods to a new approach. Blockchain Organizing is presented as a means to solve management problems and is particularly relevant in the context of blockchain innovation, where traditional management approaches may be insufficient.
