    <edge source="Blockchain Organizing" target="Organization">
      <data key="d5">9.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain Organizing is a management concept and method that applies blockchain technology to organizations. It aims to enhance organizational productivity and flexibility. Implemented within organizations, it serves as a tool for managing transactions and is presented as an alternative to traditional organizational structures. Blockchain Organizing uses the organization as its starting point and is discussed in the context of its future role in society. It highlights advantages over structures with permanent employees and contracts.
</data>
