      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
      <data key="d6">After a successful Proof of Concept, Blockchain Organizing is further developed.</data>
      <data key="d7">Progression</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ea9da2d129b1ea0eedd60a5debc5dab2</data>
