    </edge>
    <edge source="Blockchain Organizing" target="Leader">
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain Organizing emphasizes the specific qualities and responsibilities of a leader in a context where established paths are absent. It requires a leader who understands the need for structural solutions to management problems and is prepared for a long journey with potential setbacks.</data>
      <data key="d7">Leadership, Context</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-d98a59ed81543294260a33227b3460f6</data>
      <data key="d9">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Blockchain Organizing" target="Project Members">
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Blockchain Organizing acknowledges that the group will enter territory where nobody has gone before. This can cause confusion, anxiety and sometimes raise fear among the project members.</data>
      <data key="d7">Uncertainty, Impact</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-d98a59ed81543294260a33227b3460f6</data>
      <data key="d9">WB8_BlockchainOrganizing_Managers_book8p1v1_UK_KOPIE_INTERN_GERBRUIK (1).txt</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Blockchain Organizing" target="Authority">
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
      <data key="d6">Authority is related to Blockchain Organizing as one should be regarded as an expert in this area.</data>
